## “Works Locally, Fails in CI”
- Confirm node/pnpm versions match CI.
- Clear cache and reinstall deps.
```sh
rm -rf node_modules
pnpm install
```

## “Button Stuck Loading”
Common causes:
- request promise never resolves/rejects
- error path doesn’t clear loading state
- race between stale state and navigation

Quick checks:
- inspect network tab for pending requests
- verify error boundary / toast path triggers
- confirm retries/timeouts don’t swallow errors

## “Only for Some Users”
- Feature flags (targeting/overrides)
- Permissions/role checks
- Account state differences (new vs existing users)

